    <elementInformations>
        <elementInformation name="manufacturer" show="1">Sigenergy</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference" show="1">11110015</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="designation" show="1">Sigen Gateway HomeMax SP 12K</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="description" show="1">gateway/backup; komunikacija: 2x FE (RJ45), RS485 (rezervirano), DI1 (bypass), DI2 (ATS), DO1 (omrežni kontaktor), DO2 (kontaktor agregata), DO3 (2-žilni zagon agregata)</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="notes" show="1">Viri: Datasheet Sigen Energy Gateway HomeMax SP 12K / HomeMax TP (nizozemski, uradna predloga Sigenergy) - VIR PRODAJALEC: gostuje GPC Europe (res.cloudinary.com), ker ga Sigenergy Download Center nima str. 1; Sigen Gateway HomeMax (SP, SP 12K) Installation Guide, v05 (2025-12-11); iz ZIP Sigen Gateway HomeMax (SP, SP 12K) Installer Manual_EN.zip str. 2 (Port Description), 3 (notranjost QF/KM), 5 (kabli), 10 (QF3-QF5 max 22 kW), 14-15 (FE/RS485/DI/DO, 2 izvedbi), 18 (vklop, QS1); Sigen Energy Gateway Home Series User Manual, v08 (2026-06-05) str. 25-27 (HomePro SP), 33-35 (HomeMax SP), 36-38 (HomeMax SP 12K), 55-57 (HomePro TP), 59-61 (HomeMax TP) - risbe mer; Application Note - How to connect the Generator to Sigen Energy Gateway</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="mass_kg" show="1">19</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="width" show="1">455</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="height" show="1">660</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="depth" show="1">179</elementInformation>
    </elementInformations>
    <informations>Viri: Datasheet Sigen Energy Gateway HomeMax SP 12K / HomeMax TP (nizozemski, uradna predloga Sigenergy) - VIR PRODAJALEC: gostuje GPC Europe (res.cloudinary.com), ker ga Sigenergy Download Center nima str. 1; Sigen Gateway HomeMax (SP, SP 12K) Installation Guide, v05 (2025-12-11); iz ZIP Sigen Gateway HomeMax (SP, SP 12K) Installer Manual_EN.zip str. 2 (Port Description), 3 (notranjost QF/KM), 5 (kabli), 10 (QF3-QF5 max 22 kW), 14-15 (FE/RS485/DI/DO, 2 izvedbi), 18 (vklop, QS1); Sigen Energy Gateway Home Series User Manual, v08 (2026-06-05) str. 25-27 (HomePro SP), 33-35 (HomeMax SP), 36-38 (HomeMax SP 12K), 55-57 (HomePro TP), 59-61 (HomeMax TP) - risbe mer; Application Note - How to connect the Generator to Sigen Energy Gateway
Drawn with terminals2qet 0.2.0 from the terminal table</informations>
